    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tier 2 Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic policy reform and management and private sector development</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indonesian Government continues its efforts to streamline trade across borders and reduce trade logistics costs, including through improvements to the national logistics ecosystem (NLE). The Ministry of Finance, through its Directorate General of Customs and Excise and Lembaga National Single Window (an electronic trade portal) identified two areas of focus in 2023, including to: (1) develop quantitative performance indicators and (2) review the effectiveness of the national logistics ecosystem in reducing costs. Based on Lembaga National Single Window user and stakeholder research, Australia delivered an analysis of the platform&#x2019;s effectiveness, identified key performance indicators, and assisted with developing an action plan to improve NLE performance in 2024.</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-07-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-06-30"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
